title: Day6_Hermes_ReturnFancy
tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hermes" "Hermes 3_4" "right" "bottom" #023020>>
<<AddHermesAffinity 1>>

Aelius: [Smirk] Made your sandwich, hope it satiates your endless hunger.

Hermes: You went all out on this sandwich, huh? Looks great!

Hermes: You’ve outdone yourself as always, Aelius.
Aelius: Glad to hear it's good.
Hermes: Y’know, while you were chef-ing it up, I did some thinking.
Aelius: About what?
Hermes: You had a good point earlier. Really made me take some steps back instead of running forward for once.
Hermes: I never really have taken the time to think through my problems.
Hermes: Dashing away from things is one of my specialties, after all.
Aelius: [Smirk]  (Laughing) Okay funn guy, keep going.
Hermes: Well… I guess I’m just too busy with important messages to really take some me-time.
Hermes: I know I tend to just joke about it, and never really tackle the problems.
Hermes: I’m supposed to be an all-knowing god, but I don’t feel all-knowing right now.

-> You're doing it again, Hermes. (deference)
    <<AddHermesAffinity 2>>
    Hermes: Whoopsies! Old habits die hard.
-> For someone who is admitting their problem, you sure are doing said problem right now. (humorous)
    <<AddHermesAffinity 3>>
    Hermes: Wait- oh, *<i>laughs</i> I am, aren't I?
-> You gotta quit doing it, Hermes. (aggressive)
    <<AddHermesAffinity 1>>
    Hermes: Oh, heh... right.

Hermes: I’ll keep working on it. Next thing you know, I’ll be the most honest god on Olympus.
Aelius: [Positive] Will you now? We’ll have to wait and see.
Hermes: Thanks, Aelius, by the way. I appreciate you listening to my chit-chat.
Hermes: Felt good, actually.
Hermes: Got another dish for your mom?
Aelius: [Positive] I do! Thanks, Hermes; let me go grab it.

// SPRITE TRANSITION

Aelius: [Positive] Here. I really do appreciate you doing it with how busy you are. You’re the best.
Hermes: No skin off my back. I’m happy to help.
Hermes: You remind me of myself, actually.
Aelius: [Smirk] I'll take that as a good thing.
Aelius: [Positive] Safe travels, and thanks for being open with me.
Hermes: Of course. See ya, Aelius!
<<HideAll>>
<<jump Day6_Hera_Intro>>
